Package: BGS
Title: Bedrock and Superficial Geology of the United Kingdom
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Martin R.", "Smith", , "martin.smith@durham.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5660-1727"))
Description: Reports the bedrock and superficial deposits mapped by the
    British Geological Survey at given points on land or at sea, located by
    latitude and longitude, British National Grid coordinates or Ordnance
    Survey grid references. Contains the 1:625 000 geological map of the UK
    and the 1:250 000 bedrock and seabed sediment maps of its continental
    shelf. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the British Geological Survey.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Copyright: Map data in 'inst/extdata' (c) UKRI, under the Open Government
    Licence v3.0; see file 'inst/COPYRIGHTS'.
URL: https://github.com/geol-skills/BGS
BugReports: https://github.com/geol-skills/BGS/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Suggests:
    spelling,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/Needs/coverage: covr
